<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Hardware Profile Summary</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Full Metrics</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We employ NVIDIA Nsight Compute (v2024.1) to collect fine-grained hardware performance counters. Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Full Metrics ‣ Appendix A Hardware Profile Summary ‣ Making LLMs Optimize Multi-Scenario CUDA Kernels Like Experts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> lists the key metrics we filter and extract from these counters, organized by profiling section:</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Filtered Hardware Performance Metrics for Bottleneck Analysis by Profiling Section.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T6.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Profiling Section</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T6.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.T6.5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Analysis Focus</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T6.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.T6.5.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Filtered Key Metrics</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T6.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Compute Workload Analysis</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
