<span id="A3.T7.5.8.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a matrix <math id="A3.T7.m50" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> and a vector <math id="A3.T7.m51" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix and vector multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m52" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Ax" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Ax</annotation></semantics></math> and write it into vector <math id="A3.T7.m53" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m54" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m55" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(M,N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(M,N)</annotation></semantics></math>, vector <math id="A3.T7.m56" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m57" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(N)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.8.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.8.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.8.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m58" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{8},2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{8},2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16}\}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m59" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=2048" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=2048</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m60" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(M,N)=O(MN)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(M,N)=O(MN)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">8</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMV COO</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.9.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m61" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in Coordinate (COO) format and a dense vector <math id="A3.T7.m62" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix-vector multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m63" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}={A}{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}={A}{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m64" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m65" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density like <math id="A3.T7.m66" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and vector <math id="A3.T7.m67" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">cols</span>. The result vector <math id="A3.T7.m69" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">rows</span>. The COO format consists of three arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix with length <span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">row_indices</span>: Row indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">col_indices</span>: Column indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.9.4.1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.9.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.9.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m77" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m78" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}=2048" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}=2048</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.9.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span> = <math id="A3.T7.m80" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m81" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz)=O(nnz)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz)=O(nnz)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">9</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMM COO</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.10.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m82" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> in Coordinate (COO) format and a dense matrix <math id="A3.T7.m83" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m84" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=AB" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=AB</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m85" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m86" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density like <math id="A3.T7.m87" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and matrix <math id="A3.T7.m88" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m89" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{cols},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{cols},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The result matrix <math id="A3.T7.m90" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m91" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The COO format consists of three arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix with length <span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">row_indices</span>: Row indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">col_indices</span>: Column indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.10.4.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.10.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.10.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m98" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}=\{2^{8},2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}=\{2^{8},2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.10.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">cols</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m99" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> = 4096
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m100" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m101" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">10</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMV CSC</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.11.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m102" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in Compressed Sparse Column (CSC) format and a dense vector <math id="A3.T7.m103" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix-vector multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m104" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}={A}{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}={A}{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m105" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m106" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density like <math id="A3.T7.m107" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and vector <math id="A3.T7.m108" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">cols</span>. The result vector <math id="A3.T7.m110" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">rows</span>. The CSC format consists of three arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix with length <span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">row_indices</span>: Row indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.11.4.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">col_offsets</span>: Starting index of each column in the values array with length <math id="A3.T7.m117" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.11.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.11.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m118" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.11.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">rows</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m120" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m121" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz)=O(nnz)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz)=O(nnz)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">11</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMM CSC</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.12.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m122" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in Compressed Sparse Column (CSC) format and a dense matrix <math id="A3.T7.m123" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{B}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m124" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{C}={A}{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{C}={A}{B}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m125" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m126" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density like <math id="A3.T7.m127" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and matrix <math id="A3.T7.m128" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{B}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m129" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{cols},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{cols},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The result matrix <math id="A3.T7.m130" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{C}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m131" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The CSC format consists of three arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.12.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix with length <span id="A3.T7.5.12.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m134" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{row}\_\textit{indices}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">indices</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{row}\_\textit{indices}</annotation></semantics></math>: Row indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.12.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m136" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{col}\_\textit{offsets}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">col</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">offsets</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{col}\_\textit{offsets}</annotation></semantics></math>: Starting index of each column in the values array with length <math id="A3.T7.m137" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.12.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.12.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m138" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.12.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">rows</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m139" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> = 4096
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m140" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m141" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">12</span>
</span></td>
