<span id="A3.T7.5.13.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.13.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMV CSR</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.13.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m142" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in Compressed Sparse Row (CSR) format and a dense vector <math id="A3.T7.m143" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix-vector multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m144" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}={A}{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}={A}{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m145" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m146" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density like <math id="A3.T7.m147" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and vector <math id="A3.T7.m148" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">cols</span>. The result vector <math id="A3.T7.m150" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">rows</span>. The CSR format consists of three arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix with length <span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m154" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{col}\_\textit{indices}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">col</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">indices</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{col}\_\textit{indices}</annotation></semantics></math>: Column indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.13.4.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m156" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{row}\_\textit{offsets}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">offsets</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{row}\_\textit{offsets}</annotation></semantics></math>: Starting index of each row in the values array with length <math id="A3.T7.m157" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.13.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.13.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m158" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.13.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">cols</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m159" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m160" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz)=O(nnz)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz)=O(nnz)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">13</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.14.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMM CSR</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.14.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m161" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in Compressed Sparse Row (CSR) format and a dense matrix <math id="A3.T7.m162" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{B}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m163" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{C}={A}{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{C}={A}{B}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m164" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m165" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density like <math id="A3.T7.m166" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and matrix <math id="A3.T7.m167" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{B}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m168" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{cols},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{cols},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The result matrix <math id="A3.T7.m169" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{C}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m170" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The CSR format consists of three arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.14.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix with length <span id="A3.T7.5.14.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m173" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{col}\_\textit{indices}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">col</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">indices</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{col}\_\textit{indices}</annotation></semantics></math>: Column indices for each non-zero element with length <span id="A3.T7.5.14.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">nnz</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m175" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{row}\_\textit{offsets}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">offsets</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{row}\_\textit{offsets}</annotation></semantics></math>: Starting index of each row in the values array with length <math id="A3.T7.m176" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.14.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.14.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m177" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.14.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">cols</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m178" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> = 4096
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m179" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m180" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">14</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.15.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMV ELL</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.15.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m181" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in ELL format and a dense vector <math id="A3.T7.m182" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix-vector multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m183" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}={A}{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}={A}{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m184" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m185" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density of <math id="A3.T7.m186" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.01</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, and vector <math id="A3.T7.m187" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.15.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">cols</span>. The result vector <math id="A3.T7.m189" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{y}</annotation></semantics></math> has length <span id="A3.T7.5.15.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">rows</span>. The ELL format stores sparse matrices using two arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.15.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix, padded to a fixed length per row, with total size:
<math id="A3.T7.m192" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_nnz_per_row</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}</annotation></semantics></math>. Padding positions are marked with <math id="A3.T7.m193" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.15.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">col_ids</span>: Column indices for each corresponding non-zero element, with total size <math id="A3.T7.m195" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_nnz_per_row</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}</annotation></semantics></math>. Padding positions are marked with <math id="A3.T7.m196" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.15.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.15.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m197" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.15.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">rows</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m198" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m199" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz)=O(nnz)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz)=O(nnz)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">15</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sparse Matrix</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SpMM ELL</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.16.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a sparse matrix <math id="A3.T7.m200" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> in ELL format and a dense matrix <math id="A3.T7.m201" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{B}</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the result of matrix multiplication <math id="A3.T7.m202" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{C}={AB}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{C}={AB}</annotation></semantics></math>, where matrix <math id="A3.T7.m203" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{A}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m204" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},\textit{cols})</annotation></semantics></math> with a specified sparsity density of 0.01, and matrix <math id="A3.T7.m205" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{B}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m206" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{cols},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{cols},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The result matrix <math id="A3.T7.m207" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{C}</annotation></semantics></math> has a shape of <math id="A3.T7.m208" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{rows},K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{rows},K)</annotation></semantics></math>. The ELL format stores sparse matrices using two arrays:

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.16.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">values</span>: Non-zero elements of the matrix, padded to a fixed length per row, with total size:
<math id="A3.T7.m210" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_nnz_per_row</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}</annotation></semantics></math>. Padding positions are marked with <math id="A3.T7.m211" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.16.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">col_ids</span>: Column indices for each corresponding non-zero element, with total size <math id="A3.T7.m213" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_nnz_per_row</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{rows}\times\textit{max\_nnz\_per\_row}</annotation></semantics></math>. Padding positions are marked with <math id="A3.T7.m214" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.16.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.16.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m215" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cols}=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14},2^{15}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.16.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">rows</span> = 2048

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m216" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K=4096" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K=4096</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m217" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">nnz</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">rows</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cols</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{nnz}=\textit{rows}\times\textit{cols}\times 0.01</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m218" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(nnz,K)=O(nnz\times K)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">16</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Normal-
<br class="ltx_break">ization</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.17.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Batch Norm</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.17.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Implement batch normalization for a tensor of shape <math id="A3.T7.m219" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[N,C]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[N,C]</annotation></semantics></math> using scale vector <math id="A3.T7.m220" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> and shift vector <math id="A3.T7.m221" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> parameters of length <math id="A3.T7.m222" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math>. The formula is as follows:
<math id="A3.T7.m223" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{j}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}x_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{j}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}x_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m224" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{Var}_{j}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_{i,j}-\mu_{j})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Var</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{Var}_{j}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_{i,j}-\mu_{j})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m225" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{output}_{i,j}=\frac{x_{i,j}-\mu_{j}}{\sqrt{\textit{Var}_{j}+\epsilon}}\gamma_{j}+\beta_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">output</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Var</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{output}_{i,j}=\frac{x_{i,j}-\mu_{j}}{\sqrt{\textit{Var}_{j}+\epsilon}}\gamma_{j}+\beta_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.17.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.17.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m226" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{4},2^{6},2^{8},2^{10}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{4},2^{6},2^{8},2^{10}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m227" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=\{2^{4},2^{6},2^{8},2^{10}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=\{2^{4},2^{6},2^{8},2^{10}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m228" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N,C)=O(NC)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N,C)=O(NC)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">17</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Normal-
<br class="ltx_break">ization</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.18.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">RMS Norm</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.18.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given an input tensor <math id="A3.T7.m229" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{X}</annotation></semantics></math> of dimension <math id="A3.T7.m230" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(N)</annotation></semantics></math>, and additional parameters <math id="A3.T7.m231" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{w}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.T7.m232" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{b}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A3.T7.m233" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, compute the RMS normalization of the input sequence:
<math id="A3.T7.m234" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{RMS}({X})=\sqrt{\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}{X}_{i}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">RMS</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{RMS}({X})=\sqrt{\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}{X}_{i}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m235" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{Y}=\frac{{X}}{\textit{RMS}({X})+\epsilon}\cdot{w}+{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi>X</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">RMS</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Y}=\frac{{X}}{\textit{RMS}({X})+\epsilon}\cdot{w}+{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.18.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.18.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m236" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{6},2^{7},2^{8},2^{9},2^{10}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{6},2^{7},2^{8},2^{9},2^{10}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m237" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">18</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Normal-
<br class="ltx_break">ization</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.19.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Layer Norm</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.19.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Normalize an <math id="A3.T7.m238" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional vector <math id="A3.T7.m239" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, where the vector has a mean <math id="A3.T7.m240" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu({x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu({x})</annotation></semantics></math>, a standard deviation <math id="A3.T7.m241" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma({x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma({x})</annotation></semantics></math>, and parameters <math id="A3.T7.m242" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional vector <math id="A3.T7.m243" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{w}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.T7.m244" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional vector <math id="A3.T7.m245" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{b}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <span id="A3.T7.5.19.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">epsilon</span>. The formula is as follows:

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m247" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu({x})=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu({x})=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m248" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{Var}({x})=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_{i}-\mu({x}))^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Var</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{Var}({x})=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_{i}-\mu({x}))^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m249" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{Y}=\frac{{x}-\mu({x})}{\sqrt{\textit{Var}({x})+\epsilon}}\cdot{w}+{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Var</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Y}=\frac{{x}-\mu({x})}{\sqrt{\textit{Var}({x})+\epsilon}}\cdot{w}+{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.19.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.19.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m250" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{6},2^{7},2^{8},2^{9},2^{10}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{6},2^{7},2^{8},2^{9},2^{10}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m251" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">19</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Normal-
<br class="ltx_break">ization</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.20.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Softmax</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.20.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The softmax operator is calculated by applying the softmax function to a tensor <math id="A3.T7.m252" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> of shape <math id="A3.T7.m253" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(N,C)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(N,C)</annotation></semantics></math> of each row with length <math id="A3.T7.m254" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math>. For each row <math id="A3.T7.m255" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> where <math id="A3.T7.m256" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=0</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.T7.m257" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math>, compute:
<math id="A3.T7.m258" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\textit{row}_{i}={x}[i,:]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{row}_{i}={x}[i,:]</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m259" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=\max(\textit{row}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=\max(\textit{row}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m260" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{softmax}(\it{row}_{i})=\frac{\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M)}{\sum(\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M))}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝑟𝑜𝑤</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" rspace="0em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.700em">row</mtext><mi mathsize="0.710em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">M</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{softmax}(\it{row}_{i})=\frac{\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M)}{\sum(\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M))}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.20.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.20.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m261" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{4},2^{5},2^{6},2^{7}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{4},2^{5},2^{6},2^{7}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m262" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=\{2^{8},2^{10},2^{12},2^{14}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=\{2^{8},2^{10},2^{12},2^{14}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m263" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N,C)=O(NC)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N,C)=O(NC)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">20</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.21.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Sigmoid</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.21.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The sigmoid operator is calculated by applying the sigmoid function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m264" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m265" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{sigmoid}(x)=\frac{1}{1+e^{-x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">sigmoid</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{sigmoid}(x)=\frac{1}{1+e^{-x}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.21.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.21.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m266" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m267" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.22" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">21</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.22.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.22.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Selu</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.22.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The selu operator is calculated by applying the selu function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m268" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> with a slope <math id="A3.T7.m269" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> and a scale <math id="A3.T7.m270" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m271" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{selu}(x)=\lambda x\text{ if }x&gt;0,\text{ otherwise }\lambda\alpha(e^{x}-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">selu</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext> otherwise </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{selu}(x)=\lambda x\text{ if }x&gt;0,\text{ otherwise }\lambda\alpha(e^{x}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.22.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.22.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m272" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m273" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.23" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">22</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.23.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.23.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Elu</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.23.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The elu operator is calculated by applying the elu function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m274" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> with a slope <math id="A3.T7.m275" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m276" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{elu}(x)=x\text{ if }x&gt;0,\text{ otherwise }\alpha(e^{x}-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">elu</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext> otherwise </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{elu}(x)=x\text{ if }x&gt;0,\text{ otherwise }\alpha(e^{x}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.23.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.23.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m277" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m278" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.24" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.24.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">23</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.24.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.24.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Gelu</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.24.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The gelu operator is calculated by applying the gelu function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m279" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m280" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{gelu}(x)=x\Phi(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">gelu</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{gelu}(x)=x\Phi(x)</annotation></semantics></math>
Where <math id="A3.T7.m281" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi(x)=\frac{1+\textit{erf}(x/\sqrt{2})}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">erf</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi(x)=\frac{1+\textit{erf}(x/\sqrt{2})}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.24.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.24.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m282" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m283" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.25" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.25.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">24</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.25.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.25.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Row Tanh</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.25.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The row tanh operator is calculated by applying the tanh function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m284" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m285" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{tanh}(x)=\frac{e^{x}-e^{-x}}{e^{x}+e^{-x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tanh</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{tanh}(x)=\frac{e^{x}-e^{-x}}{e^{x}+e^{-x}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.25.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.25.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m286" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m287" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.26" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.26.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">25</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.26.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.26.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Relu</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.26.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The Relu operator is calculated by applying the Relu function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m288" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m289" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{Relu}(x)=\max(0,x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Relu</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{Relu}(x)=\max(0,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.26.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.26.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m290" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m291" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.27" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.27.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">26</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.27.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Activate Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.27.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Leaky Relu</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.27.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The Leaky Relu operator is calculated by applying the Leaky Relu function to a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m292" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> with a small slope <math id="A3.T7.m293" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m294" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{Leaky\_relu}(x)=x\text{ if }x&gt;0,\text{ otherwise }x\cdot\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Leaky_relu</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext> otherwise </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{Leaky\_relu}(x)=x\text{ if }x&gt;0,\text{ otherwise }x\cdot\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.27.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.27.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m295" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m296" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">27</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.28.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Loss Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.28.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">MSE Loss</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.28.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given two vectors <math id="A3.T7.m297" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{X}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.T7.m298" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Y}</annotation></semantics></math>, each of length <math id="A3.T7.m299" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate their mean squared error <math id="A3.T7.m300" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{MSE}({X},{Y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">MSE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{MSE}({X},{Y})</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m301" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{MSE}({X},{Y})=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}({X}[i]-{Y}[i])^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">MSE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{MSE}({X},{Y})=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}({X}[i]-{Y}[i])^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.28.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.28.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m302" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m303" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.29" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">28</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.29.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Loss Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.29.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Hinge Loss</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.29.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The hinge loss operator is given a sequence of length <math id="A3.T7.m304" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, and two input arrays: <span id="A3.T7.5.29.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">predictions</span> and <span id="A3.T7.5.29.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">targets</span>. The <span id="A3.T7.5.29.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">predictions</span> array contains the predicted values, and the <span id="A3.T7.5.29.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">targets</span> array contains the true binary labels (<math id="A3.T7.m309" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> or <math id="A3.T7.m310" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math>). The operator calculates the hinge loss for each sample in the sequence using the formula:
if <math id="A3.T7.m311" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{target}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">target</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{target}=1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.T7.m312" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{hinge\_loss}(x)=\max(0,1-\textit{pred})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">hinge_loss</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">pred</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{hinge\_loss}(x)=\max(0,1-\textit{pred})</annotation></semantics></math>
if <math id="A3.T7.m313" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{target}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">target</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{target}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.T7.m314" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{hinge\_loss}(x)=\max(0,1+\textit{pred})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">hinge_loss</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">pred</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{hinge\_loss}(x)=\max(0,1+\textit{pred})</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.29.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.29.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m315" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m316" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.30" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">29</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.30.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Loss Function</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.30.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Cross Entropy Loss</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.30.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a predicted probability distribution <math id="A3.T7.m317" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{X}</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="A3.T7.m318" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A3.T7.m319" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of classes, and an actual probability distribution <math id="A3.T7.m320" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Y}</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="A3.T7.m321" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, compute their cross entropy loss <math id="A3.T7.m322" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{cross\_entropy\_loss}({X},{Y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cross_entropy_loss</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cross\_entropy\_loss}({X},{Y})</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m323" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\textit{cross\_entropy\_loss}({X},{Y})=-\sum_{i=1}^{N}{Y}[i]\cdot\log({X}[i])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">cross_entropy_loss</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>log</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{cross\_entropy\_loss}({X},{Y})=-\sum_{i=1}^{N}{Y}[i]\cdot\log({X}[i])</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.30.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.30.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m324" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{14},2^{16},2^{18},2^{20},2^{22}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>22</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{14},2^{16},2^{18},2^{20},2^{22}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m325" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.31" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">30</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.31.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">LLM Operator Sequence</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.31.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Softmax Attention</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.31.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given the query matrix <math id="A3.T7.m326" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Q}</annotation></semantics></math> of size <math id="A3.T7.m327" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{q\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_qk}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">q_seq_len</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim_qk</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{q\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_qk}]</annotation></semantics></math>, key matrix <math id="A3.T7.m328" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{K}</annotation></semantics></math> of size <math id="A3.T7.m329" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{kv\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_qk}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kv_seq_len</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim_qk</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{kv\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_qk}]</annotation></semantics></math>, and value matrix <math id="A3.T7.m330" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{V}</annotation></semantics></math> of size <math id="A3.T7.m331" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{kv\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_v}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kv_seq_len</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim_v</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{kv\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_v}]</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the softmax attention by the formula:
<math id="A3.T7.m332" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y=\textit{softmax}(\frac{QK^{T}}{\sqrt{\textit{dim\_qk}}})V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim_qk</mtext></msqrt></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y=\textit{softmax}(\frac{QK^{T}}{\sqrt{\textit{dim\_qk}}})V</annotation></semantics></math>
where softmax of shape <math id="A3.T7.m333" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[N,C]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[N,C]</annotation></semantics></math> is defined as:
For each row <math id="A3.T7.m334" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> (where <math id="A3.T7.m335" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=0</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.T7.m336" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math>), compute:
<math id="A3.T7.m337" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\textit{row}_{i}={x}[i,:]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{row}_{i}={x}[i,:]</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m338" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=\max(\textit{row}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=\max(\textit{row}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m339" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{softmax}(\textit{row}_{i})=\frac{\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M)}{\sum(\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M))}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">row</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" rspace="0em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" mathsize="0.700em">row</mtext><mi mathsize="0.710em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">M</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{softmax}(\textit{row}_{i})=\frac{\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M)}{\sum(\exp(\textit{row}_{i}-M))}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.31.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.31.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m340" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{q\_seq\_len},\textit{kv\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_qk},\newline
\textit{dim\_v}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">q_seq_len</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kv_seq_len</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim_qk</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim_v</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{q\_seq\_len},\textit{kv\_seq\_len},\textit{dim\_qk},\newline
\textit{dim\_v}]</annotation></semantics></math> =
{[128, 256, 512, 512],
[256, 512, 1024, 1024],
[512, 1024, 2048, 2048],
[1024, 2048, 4096, 4096],
[256, 1024, 2048, 1024],
[512, 512, 1024, 2048],
[1024, 1024, 4096, 2048],
[128, 2048, 512, 4096]}

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m341" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(q\_seq\_len,kv\_seq\_len,dim\_qk" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(q\_seq\_len,kv\_seq\_len,dim\_qk</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m342" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext=",dim\_v)=O(q\_seq\_len\times kv\_seq\_len\times(dim\_qk+dim\_v))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">,dim\_v)=O(q\_seq\_len\times kv\_seq\_len\times(dim\_qk+dim\_v))</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.32" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.32.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">31</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.32.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">LLM Operator Sequence</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.32.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Triangle Attention</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.32.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given the query, key, value matrix of shape <math id="A3.T7.m343" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{batch\_size},\textit{head\_num},\textit{seq\_length},\textit{head\_dim}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">batch_size</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">head_num</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">seq_length</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">head_dim</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{batch\_size},\textit{head\_num},\textit{seq\_length},\textit{head\_dim}]</annotation></semantics></math> and an upper triangular matrix attention mask of shape <math id="A3.T7.m344" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{batch\_size},\textit{seq\_length},\textit{seq\_length}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">batch_size</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">seq_length</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">seq_length</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{batch\_size},\textit{seq\_length},\textit{seq\_length}]</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the triangle attention matrix of shape <math id="A3.T7.m345" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{batch\_size},\textit{head\_num},\textit{seq\_length},\textit{head\_dim}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">batch_size</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">head_num</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">seq_length</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">head_dim</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{batch\_size},\textit{head\_num},\textit{seq\_length},\textit{head\_dim}]</annotation></semantics></math>.
for each <math id="A3.T7.m346" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> in <span id="A3.T7.5.32.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">batch_size</span> and <math id="A3.T7.m348" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> in <span id="A3.T7.5.32.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">head_num</span>:
<math id="A3.T7.m350" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{Q},{K},{V}=\textit{query}[b,h,:,:],\textit{key}[b,h,:,:],\textit{value}[b,h,:,:]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">query</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">key</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">value</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Q},{K},{V}=\textit{query}[b,h,:,:],\textit{key}[b,h,:,:],\textit{value}[b,h,:,:]</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m351" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{M}=\textit{mask}[b,:,:]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">mask</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{M}=\textit{mask}[b,:,:]</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m352" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{S}=\frac{{Q}{K}^{T}}{\sqrt{\textit{head\_dim}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">head_dim</mtext></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{S}=\frac{{Q}{K}^{T}}{\sqrt{\textit{head\_dim}}}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m353" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{S}_{\textit{masked}}={S}\odot{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">masked</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{S}_{\textit{masked}}={S}\odot{M}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m354" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{P}=\textit{tril\_softmax}({S}_{\textit{masked}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tril_softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">masked</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{P}=\textit{tril\_softmax}({S}_{\textit{masked}})</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m355" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{O}={P}{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{O}={P}{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.32.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.32.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">[<span id="A3.T7.5.32.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">batch_size</span>, <span id="A3.T7.5.32.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">head_num</span>, <span id="A3.T7.5.32.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">seq_length</span>, <span id="A3.T7.5.32.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">head_dim</span>] =
{[1, 32, 512, 128],
[1, 96, 256, 128],
[1, 48, 1024, 128],
[2, 16, 256, 256],
[2, 64, 512, 128],
[4, 8, 32, 128],
[4, 32, 512, 128],
[8, 16, 512, 128]}

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m356" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(batch\_size,head\_num," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(batch\_size,head\_num,</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m357" class="ltx_Math" alttext="seq\_length,head\_dim)=O(batch\_size\times head\_num\times seq\_length^{2}\times head\_dim)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">seq\_length,head\_dim)=O(batch\_size\times head\_num\times seq\_length^{2}\times head\_dim)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.33" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.33.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">32</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.33.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">LLM Operator Sequence</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.33.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Merge Attention States</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.33.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The merge_attn_states operator will accept two tensors <math id="A3.T7.m358" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{V}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{V}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.T7.m359" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{V}_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{V}_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> of the same shape <math id="A3.T7.m360" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{num\_tokens},\textit{num\_heads},\textit{head\_size}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">num_tokens</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">num_heads</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">head_size</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{num\_tokens},\textit{num\_heads},\textit{head\_size}]</annotation></semantics></math>, and two <math id="A3.T7.m361" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{LSE}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">LSE</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{LSE}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.T7.m362" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{LSE}_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>LSE</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{LSE}_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> of the same shape <math id="A3.T7.m363" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\textit{num\_heads},\textit{num\_tokens}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">num_heads</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">num_tokens</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\textit{num\_heads},\textit{num\_tokens}]</annotation></semantics></math>, and perform merge exponential normalization:
For each head <math id="A3.T7.m364" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> and token <math id="A3.T7.m365" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m366" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{max\_lse}=\max(\textit{LSE}_{a}[h,t],\textit{LSE}_{b}[h,t])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_lse</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">LSE</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">LSE</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{max\_lse}=\max(\textit{LSE}_{a}[h,t],\textit{LSE}_{b}[h,t])</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m367" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{a}=\exp(\textit{LSE}_{a}[h,t]-\textit{max\_lse})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">LSE</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_lse</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{a}=\exp(\textit{LSE}_{a}[h,t]-\textit{max\_lse})</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m368" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{b}=\exp(\textit{LSE}_{b}[h,t]-\textit{max\_lse})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">LSE</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_lse</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{b}=\exp(\textit{LSE}_{b}[h,t]-\textit{max\_lse})</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m369" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{total\_w}=w_{a}+w_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">total_w</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{total\_w}=w_{a}+w_{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.4.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m370" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{V}_{\textit{out}}[t,h,:]=({V}_{a}[t,h,:]\cdot w_{a}+{V}_{b}[t,h,:]\cdot w_{b})/\textit{total\_w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">total_w</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{V}_{\textit{out}}[t,h,:]=({V}_{a}[t,h,:]\cdot w_{a}+{V}_{b}[t,h,:]\cdot w_{b})/\textit{total\_w}</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m371" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{LSE}_{\textit{out}}[h,t]=\log(\textit{total\_w})+\textit{max\_lse}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">LSE</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">total_w</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">max_lse</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{LSE}_{\textit{out}}[h,t]=\log(\textit{total\_w})+\textit{max\_lse}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.33.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.33.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T7.5.33.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">num_tokens</span> = {512, 768, 1024} 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.33.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">num_heads</span> = {32, 64}
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.33.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">head_size</span> = {128, 256}

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m372" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(num\_tokens,num\_heads," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(num\_tokens,num\_heads,</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m373" class="ltx_Math" alttext="head\_size)=O(num\_tokens\times num\_heads\times head\_size)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">head\_size)=O(num\_tokens\times num\_heads\times head\_size)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.34" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.34.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">33</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.34.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">LLM Operator Sequence</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.34.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">SwiGLU</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.34.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The SwiGLU operator is calculated by applying the Swish-Gated Linear Unit function to two sequences <math id="A3.T7.m374" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{gate}\ {g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>gate</mtext><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{gate}\ {g}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.T7.m375" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{value}\ {v}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>value</mtext><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{value}\ {v}</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="A3.T7.m376" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>:

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m377" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{Swish}(x)=x\cdot\sigma(\beta x)=\frac{x}{1+e^{-\beta x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Swish</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{Swish}(x)=x\cdot\sigma(\beta x)=\frac{x}{1+e^{-\beta x}}</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m378" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{SwiGLU}({g},{v})=\textit{Swish}({g})\cdot{v}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">SwiGLU</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Swish</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{SwiGLU}({g},{v})=\textit{Swish}({g})\cdot{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.34.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.34.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m379" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{12},2^{14},2^{16},2^{18}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m380" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N)=O(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.35" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.35.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">34</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.35.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">LLM Operator Sequence</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.35.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Silu and Mul</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.35.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given a concatenated input in shape <math id="A3.T7.m381" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(B,2D)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(B,2D)</annotation></semantics></math>, where the first <math id="A3.T7.m382" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A3.T7.m383" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> and the second <math id="A3.T7.m384" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A3.T7.m385" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{g}</annotation></semantics></math>. Compute silu of <math id="A3.T7.m386" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> and multiply it with <math id="A3.T7.m387" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{g}</annotation></semantics></math>.
<math id="A3.T7.m388" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{x}={input}[b,:D]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}={input}[b,:D]</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m389" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{g}={input}[b,D:]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{g}={input}[b,D:]</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m390" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{out}=\textit{silu}({x})\cdot{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">silu</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{out}=\textit{silu}({x})\cdot{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.35.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.35.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m391" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B=\{16,32,64\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B=\{16,32,64\}</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m392" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D=\{4096,5120,8192,12288\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>4096</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5120</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8192</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12288</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D=\{4096,5120,8192,12288\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m393" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(B,D)=O(BD)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(B,D)=O(BD)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.36" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">35</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.36.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">LLM Operator Sequence</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.36.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Rope</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.36.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given an input tensor <math id="A3.T7.m394" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{x}</annotation></semantics></math> of shape <math id="A3.T7.m395" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(M,D)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(M,D)</annotation></semantics></math>, calculate the Rotary Positional Embedding. For each position <math id="A3.T7.m396" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> where <math id="A3.T7.m397" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=0</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.T7.m398" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M-1</annotation></semantics></math>, its <math id="A3.T7.m399" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional vector <math id="A3.T7.m400" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{v}_{m}=[x_{m,0},x_{m,1},...,x_{m,D-1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{v}_{m}=[x_{m,0},x_{m,1},...,x_{m,D-1}]</annotation></semantics></math>. For each two-dimensional pair <math id="A3.T7.m401" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x_{m,2k},x_{m,2k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x_{m,2k},x_{m,2k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A3.T7.m402" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A3.T7.m403" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(D/2)-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(D/2)-1</annotation></semantics></math>:
<math id="A3.T7.m404" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\theta_{k}=\textit{base}^{-2k/D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">base</mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{k}=\textit{base}^{-2k/D}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.T7.m405" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi(m,k)=m\cdot\theta_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi(m,k)=m\cdot\theta_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m406" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{out}[m,2k]=x_{m,2k}\cdot\cos(\phi(m,k))-x_{m,2k+1}\cdot\sin(\phi(m,k))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{out}[m,2k]=x_{m,2k}\cdot\cos(\phi(m,k))-x_{m,2k+1}\cdot\sin(\phi(m,k))</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m407" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{out}[m,2k+1]=x_{m,2k}\cdot\sin(\phi(m,k))+x_{m,2k+1}\cdot\cos(\phi(m,k))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{out}[m,2k+1]=x_{m,2k}\cdot\sin(\phi(m,k))+x_{m,2k+1}\cdot\cos(\phi(m,k))</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.36.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.36.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m408" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=\{2^{4},2^{5},2^{6},2^{7}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=\{2^{4},2^{5},2^{6},2^{7}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

