<span id="A3.T7.5.39.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Transpose a matrix <math id="A3.T7.m425" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> of dimension <math id="A3.T7.m426" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(M,N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(M,N)</annotation></semantics></math> and output the transposed matrix <math id="A3.T7.m427" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A3.T7.m428" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> has dimensions <math id="A3.T7.m429" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(N,M)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(N,M)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.39.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.39.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.39.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m430" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14}\}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m431" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=\{2^{10},2^{11},2^{12},2^{13},2^{14}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m432" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(M,N)=O(MN)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(M,N)=O(MN)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.40" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.40.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">39</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.40.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Tensor Process</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.40.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">High Order Contraction</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.40.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Calculate the high order tensor contraction of tensor <math id="A3.T7.m433" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> of shape <math id="A3.T7.m434" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[a_{\textit{dim}},x_{\textit{dim}},b_{\textit{dim}},y_{\textit{dim}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[a_{\textit{dim}},x_{\textit{dim}},b_{\textit{dim}},y_{\textit{dim}}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.T7.m435" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> of shape <math id="A3.T7.m436" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[x_{\textit{dim}},c_{\textit{dim}},y_{\textit{dim}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[x_{\textit{dim}},c_{\textit{dim}},y_{\textit{dim}}]</annotation></semantics></math>. Write the answer into tensor <math id="A3.T7.m437" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> of shape <math id="A3.T7.m438" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[a_{\textit{dim}},b_{\textit{dim}},c_{\textit{dim}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[a_{\textit{dim}},b_{\textit{dim}},c_{\textit{dim}}]</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m439" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C[a,b,c]=\sum_{x,y}A[a,x,b,y]\times B[x,c,y]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C[a,b,c]=\sum_{x,y}A[a,x,b,y]\times B[x,c,y]</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.40.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.40.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m440" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[a_{\textit{dim}},b_{\textit{dim}},c_{\textit{dim}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[a_{\textit{dim}},b_{\textit{dim}},c_{\textit{dim}}]</annotation></semantics></math> = {[32, 32, 32], [64, 32, 48], [128, 128, 64], [256, 256, 128]} 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m441" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[x_{\textit{dim}},y_{\textit{dim}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">dim</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[x_{\textit{dim}},y_{\textit{dim}}]</annotation></semantics></math> = {[4, 4],[16, 8], [16, 16]
}

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m442" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(a_{dim},b_{dim},c_{dim},x_{dim},y_{dim})=O(a_{dim}b_{dim}c_{dim}x_{dim}y_{dim})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(a_{dim},b_{dim},c_{dim},x_{dim},y_{dim})=O(a_{dim}b_{dim}c_{dim}x_{dim}y_{dim})</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.41" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.41.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">40</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.41.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Stencil Computation</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.41.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">2D Max Pooling</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.41.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given an input signal of shape <math id="A3.T7.m443" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[N,C,H,W]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[N,C,H,W]</annotation></semantics></math>. For each output position <math id="A3.T7.m444" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(n,c,h_{\textit{out}},w_{\textit{out}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(n,c,h_{\textit{out}},w_{\textit{out}})</annotation></semantics></math>, compute the maximum value over the corresponding input window: 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m445" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{output}[n,c,h_{\textit{out}},w_{\textit{out}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">output</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{output}[n,c,h_{\textit{out}},w_{\textit{out}}]</annotation></semantics></math> = <math id="A3.T7.m446" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\max(\textit{input}[n,c,h:h+\textit{kernel\_size},w:w+\textit{kernel\_size}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">input</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kernel_size</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kernel_size</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max(\textit{input}[n,c,h:h+\textit{kernel\_size},w:w+\textit{kernel\_size}])</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break">where <math id="A3.T7.m447" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h=h_{\textit{out}}\times\textit{stride}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">stride</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h=h_{\textit{out}}\times\textit{stride}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.T7.m448" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w=w_{\textit{out}}\times\textit{stride}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">out</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">stride</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w=w_{\textit{out}}\times\textit{stride}</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break">The boundary values are filled with padding.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.41.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.41.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A3.T7.m449" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[N,C,H,W]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[N,C,H,W]</annotation></semantics></math> = {[8, 3, 512, 512], [4, 3, 224, 224], [16, 3, 608, 608], [4, 1, 2048, 196]} 
<br class="ltx_break">[<span id="A3.T7.5.41.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">kernel_size</span>, <span id="A3.T7.5.41.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">stride</span>] = {[2,1], [3,1], [4,2]}, <span id="A3.T7.5.41.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">padding</span> = {0,1} 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m450" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{out}=\lfloor\frac{(H+2\times\textit{padding}-\textit{kernelsize})}{\textit{stride}}+1\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">padding</mtext></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kernelsize</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">stride</mtext></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{out}=\lfloor\frac{(H+2\times\textit{padding}-\textit{kernelsize})}{\textit{stride}}+1\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>
<math id="A3.T7.m451" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{out}=\lfloor\frac{(W+2\times\textit{padding}-\textit{kernelsize})}{\textit{stride}}+1\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">padding</mtext></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">kernelsize</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">stride</mtext></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{out}=\lfloor\frac{(W+2\times\textit{padding}-\textit{kernelsize})}{\textit{stride}}+1\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m452" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(N,C,H_{out},W_{out},kernel\_size)=O(NCH_{out}W_{out}\times kernel\_size^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(N,C,H_{out},W_{out},kernel\_size)=O(NCH_{out}W_{out}\times kernel\_size^{2})</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.42" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.42.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">41</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.42.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Stencil Computation</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.42.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">1D Convolution</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.42.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Given an 1d input signal and an 1d kernel, compute the output signal using 1D convolution.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.42.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.42.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T7.5.42.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">input_size</span> = <math id="A3.T7.m453" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{2^{14},2^{16},2^{18},2^{20},2^{22}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>22</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{2^{14},2^{16},2^{18},2^{20},2^{22}\}</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.T7.5.42.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">kernel_size</span> = <math id="A3.T7.m454" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{32,64,128,256\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{32,64,128,256\}</annotation></semantics></math>

<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A3.T7.m455" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T(input\_size,kernel\_size)=O(input\_size\times kernel\_size)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(input\_size,kernel\_size)=O(input\_size\times kernel\_size)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.5.43" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T7.5.43.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.43.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T7.5.43.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">42</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.5.43.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T7.5.43.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:42.7pt;">
